Two migration chains share this directory (DATABASE.md §2, §6).

  foundation/  permanent from the adoption of CLAUDE.md; never edited after
               `alembic upgrade` has run against any real database.
  iteration/   regenerated fresh for each demo until the director declares a
               keeper build; immutable from that build onward.

Apply both, in this order, against an empty database:

  alembic upgrade foundation@head
  alembic upgrade iteration@head

Migrations are schema-only. No INSERT, no UPDATE, no backfill: seeds are
`python -m backend.seed --apply` and data fixes are scripts under
backend/scripts/, each re-runnable with --dry-run.
